#. type: Content of: <div><h1>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:5
msgid "BLFS News"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dt>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:8
msgid "BLFS 13.0 has been released!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:9
msgid "<em>Bruce Dubbs - 2026/03/05</em>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:11
msgid ""
"The BLFS Team is proud to present version 13.0 of Beyond Linux From "
"Scratch. This version includes over 1000 packages beyond the base "
"Linux From Scratch Version 13.0 book.  The book has over 1500 updates "
"from the previous version including many text and formatting changes. "
"This release also includes 112 security updates over the previous "
"release."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:18
msgid ""
"The book includes the GNOME, KDE Plasma, XFCE, and LXQt Desktop "
"environments. It also includes many applications including browsers, "
"email clients, video players, and office applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:23
msgid ""
"New packages that were added include: Glycin sandboxed image loader, "
"Showtime - GNOME video player, Loupe - GNOME image viewer (replacing "
"EOG), simdutf (needed for VTE), kquickimageeditor and qtkeychain "
"(needed for Plasma), kddockwidgets (needed for Kdenlive), lxqt-"
"wayland-session (adding Wayland support to LXQt), libheif and "
"libde265 (needed for Glycin), libfyaml (needed for AppStream), SVT-"
"AV1 and dav1d (adding additional support for AV1 encoding and "
"decoding), SDL3 and sdl2-compat (replacing SDL2 with significantly "
"improved support for Wayland, input devices, and more), Maturin, "
"setuptools_rust, semantic_version, and uv_build (Python modules "
"needed for CacheControl), and blueprint-compiler (Python module) used "
"by GNOME applications.  Please see the ChangeLog in the book for a "
"full list of changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:43
msgid ""
"The following packages have been removed: atkmm-2.28.x (not needed "
"with gtkmm-4), dhcpcd (not needed in systemd), bridge-utils (not "
"needed in systemd), pcre2 and sqlite (moved to LFS), Sendmail (not "
"needed with Exim and Postfix), and webp-pixbuf-loader (not needed "
"with glycin)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <div><dl><dd><p>
#: xhtml/upstream/blfs/news.html:52
msgid ""
"You can view the 13.0 systemd version at <a href=\"./view/13.0-"
"systemd\">online systemd</a> or <a href=\"./downloads/13.0-systemd/"
"\">download-systemd</a> to read locally."
msgstr ""

